# A failure inside a handler stops the window's message loop: otterPS
# reports it at the `show`, as a window that cannot be shown again.
create window into app
title of app is "Failing handler"
create button into bad
text of bad is "Fail"
when bad is clicked
    say "about to fail"
    fail with "boom"
.
put bad in app
say "showing"
show app
say "never reached"
